∇}_{x}f(x)=b=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}].\n$$"] [17592186204571 :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-71c41df8-afa0-5e4a-abb0-9a56b9c39300" :answer/id #uuid "71c41df8-afa0-5e4a-abb0-9a56b9c39300"] ["answer-71c41df8-afa0-5e4a-abb0-9a56b9c39300" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-71c41df8-afa0-5e4a-abb0-9a56b9c39300" :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]"] ["answer-c5a28dfc-770a-54c1-8dbb-3b736ea154ac" :answer/id #uuid "c5a28dfc-770a-54c1-8dbb-3b736ea154ac"] ["answer-c5a28dfc-770a-54c1-8dbb-3b736ea154ac" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-c5a28dfc-770a-54c1-8dbb-3b736ea154ac" :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]"] ["answer-38caa28c-728f-5eb5-9e10-21bbf0c1aa3d" :answer/id #uuid "38caa28c-728f-5eb5-9e10-21bbf0c1aa3d"] ["answer-38caa28c-728f-5eb5-9e10-21bbf0c1aa3d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-38caa28c-728f-5eb5-9e10-21bbf0c1aa3d" :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]"] [17592186203364 :answer-field/correct "answer-38caa28c-728f-5eb5-9e10-21bbf0c1aa3d"] [17592186203364 :answer-field/choices "answer-71c41df8-afa0-5e4a-abb0-9a56b9c39300"] [17592186203364 :answer-field/choices "answer-c5a28dfc-770a-54c1-8dbb-3b736ea154ac"] [17592186203364 :answer-field/choices "answer-38caa28c-728f-5eb5-9e10-21bbf0c1aa3d"] ["question-bfb0421c-aa0c-535f-b51f-dc865b4acd28" :question/id #uuid "bfb0421c-aa0c-535f-b51f-dc865b4acd28"] ["question-bfb0421c-aa0c-535f-b51f-dc865b4acd28" :question/math-academy-id "q-265741"] ["question-bfb0421c-aa0c-535f-b51f-dc865b4acd28" :question/problem "Given the function \n\n$$\nf(x,w)=3{w}^{T}x-2\n$$\n\nthat maps two vectors to a scalar, find ${∇}_{w}f.$"] ["question-bfb0421c-aa0c-535f-b51f-dc865b4acd28" :question/worked-solution "Using the result \n\n$$\n{∇}_{w}({w}^{T}x)=x,\n$$\n\nwe have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∇}_{w}f & ={∇}_{w}(3{w}^{T}x-2) \\\\  & =3\\cdot {∇}_{w}({w}^{T}x)-{∇}_{w}(2) \\\\  & =3\\cdot x+0 \\\\  & =3x